<h3>About</h3>
<p>Released in 1987, this is the video of Enya song <a href="/and-winter-came#TWR">"Trains and Winter Rains"</a>, from the <a href="/and-winter-came"><em>And Winter Came...</em></a> album.</p>

<p>Time: 3:18</p>
<p>Directed by Rob O'Connor</p>

<p>"Trains and Winter Rains" is a single by Irish musician Enya, the first to be taken from the album And Winter Came.... The BBC Radio 2 show Wake up to Wogan was given the world exclusive to the new song, which aired on the 29 September 2008. The song features Agnus Dei, a Christian verse commonly heard in churches. </p>

<p><strong><a href="/enya-video">&laquo; EnyaTube home</a></strong></p>

